WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.234
A few numbers anchor the study.

00:00:02.314 --> 00:00:06.639
Widths span 64 to 8192, powers of two from six to
thirteen.

00:00:06.719 --> 00:00:14.701
Every experiment is repeated ten times and reported
with ninety-five percent bootstrap confidence intervals,

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:20.076
and the covariance estimates rest on a full million
Monte-Carlo samples.

00:00:20.156 --> 00:00:25.749
Robust training uses a Jacobian coefficient of
0.01, a scaling kappa of 0.1,

00:00:25.829 --> 00:00:27.765
and a learning rate of one.

00:00:27.845 --> 00:00:34.185
The full-rank condition first kicks in at depth
eleven for GeLU and depth six for erf,

00:00:34.265 --> 00:00:40.530
and the theory's width requirement scales like
N-squared times log-N to the twelve-L.
